    "short_description": "Allianz France is the French subsidiary of the global Allianz Group, operating primarily through its majority-owned entity, AGF (Assurances Générales de France). AGF is a major insurer based in Paris, providing a wide range of insurance products while maintaining significant autonomy within the group. Allianz France has a strong presence in the French insurance market, leveraging AGF's established expertise.\n\nThe company offers comprehensive insurance solutions, including property and casualty insurance, liability and accident insurance, motor and automobile insurance, and life insurance. Allianz France also provides specialized products such as loan insurance and social security policies. With a history dating back to the early 1900s, Allianz France has evolved into a diversified financial services provider, focusing on resilience through international diversification and technology adoption.",
